<div class="app">
<header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><div class="logo" aria-hidden="true"></div>Concept<span>Bridge</span></div><div class="topright"><span>🚀 Crewmate Learning Lab</span><span class="pill">● Training simulation</span></div></header>
<main class="wrap">
<section class="welcome"><div><div class="eyebrow">CREW MISSION • CALCULUS TRAINING</div><h1>Find the missing concept.<br><span style="color:var(--blue)">Before it sabotages your calculus.</span></h1><p>A tiny gap in your foundations can sabotage the whole mission. Run a quick diagnostic, identify the suspicious concepts, and complete a focused repair mission.</p></div><div class="hero-note"><strong>5 minutes</strong><small>to find your next learning mission</small><div class="divider"></div><small>✓ No crewmate left behind<br>✓ Your progress stays on this device</small></div></section>

<section class="screen active" id="home">
<div class="layout"><div class="card"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Choose your mission</h2><span class="tag">STEP 1 OF 4</span></div><p class="sub">Select the system you want to repair first.</p>
<div class="topic-grid">
<button class="topic active" data-topic="diff"><span class="emoji">📈</span><b>Differentiation</b><small>Rates of change & derivative rules</small></button>
<button class="topic" data-topic="integral"><span class="emoji">∫</span><b>Integration</b><small>Antiderivatives & area under curves</small></button>
<button class="topic" data-topic="limits"><span class="emoji">↗</span><b>Limits & continuity</b><small>Functions approaching a value</small></button>
<button class="topic" data-topic="functions"><span class="emoji">ƒ</span><b>Functions & algebra</b><small>Build the foundations first</small></button>
</div>
<div class="quote" id="coverageLine" style="margin:-4px 0 16px">Concept coverage: power rule, constants, coefficient and sum rules, chain rule, product rule, quotient rule, tangent slopes, second derivatives.</div>
<button class="btn full" id="start">Start mission&nbsp; 🚀</button>
<div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>100,000</strong><small>question bank</small></div><div class="stat"><strong>10</strong><small>random questions per test</small></div><div class="stat"><strong>25,000</strong><small>questions per topic</small></div></div>
</div>
<aside><div class="card side-card"><h3>Ship systems map</h3><p class="sub" style="margin-bottom:14px">Each calculus skill depends on ship systems underneath. We check which one may need repairs.</p>
<div class="mapline"><span class="dot">01</span><div><b>Algebra & exponents</b><small>Manipulate expressions confidently</small></div></div>
<div class="mapline"><span class="dot">02</span><div><b>Functions</b><small>Read inputs, outputs & notation</small></div></div>
<div class="mapline"><span class="dot">03</span><div><b>Core rules</b><small>Choose the right derivative or integral rule</small></div></div>
<div class="mapline"><span class="dot">04</span><div><b>Calculus problem</b><small>Apply the concepts together</small></div></div>
</div><div class="card"><h3>What makes ConceptBridge different?</h3><div class="quote">“A wrong answer is a clue, not a dead end.”</div><p class="tiny" style="margin-bottom:0">Your results are based on the concepts tagged to these demo questions. They are clues to review, not a definitive judgement of ability.</p></div></aside></div>
</section>

<section class="screen" id="quiz"><div class="card"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">Mission scan • diagnostic</div><h2 id="quizTitle">Differentiation foundations</h2></div><button class="btn ghost" id="exitQuiz">✕ Exit</button></div><p class="sub">Choose the best answer. It's okay not to know — each response helps us choose what to review.</p><div class="quiztop"><span id="qcounter">Question 1 of 10</span><span id="qtopic">Concept check</span></div><div class="progress"><div class="progressbar" id="progressbar"></div></div><div class="qmeta" id="qtags"></div><h3 class="question" id="question"></h3><div class="options" id="options"></div><div id="answerFeedback"></div><div class="quizfoot"><span class="tiny" id="quizHint">Take your time</span><button class="btn" id="nextQuestion" disabled>Next question →</button></div></div></section>

<section class="screen" id="results"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Emergency meeting: mission report</div><div class="resulthead" style="margin:12px 0 24px"><div class="scorecircle" id="scorecircle">5/10</div><div><h2 id="resultTitle">Let's strengthen a few foundations.</h2><p id="resultSummary">Your answers point to concepts worth revisiting.</p></div></div><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Repair plan: restore the systems</h2><span class="tag">PERSONALISED</span></div><p class="sub">Start with the concepts linked to your missed answers, then use a fresh post-test to check progress.</p><div id="gapList"></div><div class="conf">The question bank contains 100,000 generated, parameter-varied questions (25,000 per topic) across 10 concept families per topic. Each test contains exactly 5 easy, 3 medium, and 2 hard questions, selected without repeats on this device until that topic bank is used. How this diagnosis works: each question is tagged to one or more concepts. Missed questions add evidence to those concept tags; repeated evidence is prioritised. This lightweight prototype uses transparent rules, not a black-box AI judgement.</div><div class="resultactions"><button class="btn" id="beginRevision">Start focused revision →</button><button class="btn secondary" id="retryHome">Back to topics</button></div></div></section>

<section class="screen" id="revision"><div class="card"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">Crew training route</div><h2>Repair. Practise. Get the ship back online.</h2></div><span class="tag">STEP 3 OF 4</span></div><p class="sub">Short, targeted refreshers for concepts flagged by your diagnostic. Read each card, then take a new quiz.</p><div id="lessonList"></div><div class="success">💡 Learning tip: explain the rule in your own words before solving the next problem.</div><div class="resultactions"><button class="btn" id="startPost">I'm ready — take the post-test →</button><button class="btn secondary" id="backResults">Back to results</button></div></div></section>

<section class="screen" id="postresults"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Mission debrief</div><div class="resulthead" style="margin:12px 0 20px"><div class="scorecircle" id="postScore">2/3</div><div><h2 id="postTitle">Your next step is clearer.</h2><p id="postSummary">Let's compare the first attempt with this fresh set.</p></div></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong id="beforeScore">—</strong><small>diagnostic score</small></div><div class="stat"><strong id="afterScore">—</strong><small>post-test score</small></div><div class="stat"><strong id="deltaScore">—</strong><small>change in accuracy</small></div></div><div class="divider"></div><h2>What this means</h2><p id="progressInsight" class="sub">Results will appear here.</p><div id="remainingGaps"></div><div class="conf">A short quiz is only an initial signal. For a stronger conclusion, use more varied questions and check progress over time.</div><div class="resultactions"><button class="btn" id="again">Start another mission</button><button class="btn secondary" id="reviewLessons">Review concepts again</button></div></div></section>
<div class="footer">ConceptBridge · Among Us hackathon prototype · 100,000 parameter-varied questions across core concepts · 5 easy / 3 medium / 2 hard per test</div>
